{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794570971131,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4abd5affeHy554lSqReHMR4","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4c3a39c001fw6TFGgY6812Ki","sessionID":"ses_e2b4abd5affeHy554lSqReHMR4","messageID":"msg_1d4c3996d001u4yycRKKG4Wumv","type":"tool","id":"call_34ee8c9fb5c8448ea65dc118","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":2,\"runId\":\"fanout-embed-text-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-embed-text-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-embed-text-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":2,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"KQ2: enriched command intent signals and re-embedded vectors on a scratch database copy\",\"findingsCount\":7,\"newInfoRatio\":0.88,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Six of seven findings are new measurements (parity, tune and holdout lift, row movement, floor silence, skill-parent dead end, vector-only scope); one restates the baseline.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ2: When the six no-recommendation commands get richer intent signals in scratch copies of their owning metadata and their command vectors are re-embedded with the live embedder, what changes in the same capture: tune recall, false offers of 35, holdout count, and the three doctor-family floor rows?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ2: When the six no-recommendation commands get richer intent signals in scratch copies of their owning metadata and their command vectors are re-embedded with the live embedder, what changes in the same capture: tune recall, false offers of 35, holdout count, and the three doctor-family floor rows?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"re-embedding /create:skill-parent with no scorer row\",\"overwriting the tracked bridge projection to test the lexical half\"],\"focusTrack\":\"embed-text\",\"edgeCase\":\"ambiguous-input\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bas