mode_floor 1 of 35, all unchanged except the plain gains.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/after-capture.json\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/before-capture.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-003\",\"label\":\"The five tune rows that moved are exactly the five scored commands and each now carries its own command at top-1; no other published tune row changed.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/after-capture.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-004\",\"label\":\"The holdout gain is two rows, from /doctor:install and /doctor:speckit each moving 0 of 1 to 1 of 1; the other three stayed 0 of 1, and only counts were read.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/after-capture.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-005\",\"label\":\"The three doctor-family floor rows at 0.82 still pass and still offer nothing: all keep system-skilled-doctor as the top and remain inside the unchanged false-offer total of 0 of 35.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/after-capture.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-006\",\"label\":\"/create:skill-parent cannot move from embedding text: it has no TypeScript bridge, no stored vector and no capture row, so its plain row stays empty despite the scratch text growing from 187 to 369 characters.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/metadata/enriched-embedding-text.json\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/after-capture.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-007\",\"label\":\"The measured gain is the vector half only: the capture still reads the tracked bridge projection for lexical evidence, so the build's lexical addition is not in these numbers; the scratch re-embed of five vectors plus two parity calls took 0.15 s wall with the model warm.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"re-embedding /create:skill-parent with no scorer row\",\"reason\":\"There is no vec_cmd_768 row and no TypeScript id, so the update would write a vector nothing reads.\",\"iteration\":2}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"overwriting the tracked bridge projection to test the lexical half\",\"reason\":\"It would modify a tracked file and break the isolation the measurement needs.\",\"iteration\":2}\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/deltas/iter-002.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/deltas/iter-002.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/deltas/iter-002.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-embed-text-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-embed-text-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-embed-text-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"run\\\":2,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"KQ2: enriched command intent signals and re-embedded vectors on a scratch database copy\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":7,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.88,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Six of seven findings are new measurements (parity, tune and holdout lift, row movement, floor silence, skill-parent dead end, vector-only scope); one restates the baseline.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"KQ2: When the six no-recommendation commands get richer intent signals in scratch copies of their owning metadata and their command vectors are re-embedded with the live embedder, what changes in the same capture: tune recall, false offers of 35, holdout count, and the three doctor-family floor rows?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"KQ2: When the six no-recommendation commands get richer intent signals in scratch copies of their owning metadata and their command vectors are re-embedded with the live embedder, what changes in the same capture: tune recall, false offers of 35, holdout count, and the three doctor-family floor rows?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"re-embedding /create:skill-parent with no scorer row\\\",\\\"overwriting the tracked bridge projection to test the lexical half\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"embed-text\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"ambiguous-input\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Bash\\\",\\\"Write\\\",\\\"Edit\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/metadata/reembed-report.json\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/after-capture.json\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/before-capture.json\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/command-metadata.json\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/command-metadata.json\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/skill-graph/scan.ts\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-13T11:55:48.000Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":308000,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The re-embed path is faithful: the unchanged /doctor:install text reproduces its stored vector at cosine 1.000000, every updated row is 3072 bytes with model nomic-embed-text-v1.5 and a matching content hash, all 14 skill vectors are byte-identical, and exactly five command vectors changed.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/metadata/reembed-report.json\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/enrich-and-embed.mjs\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"With enriched vectors the capture reads plain tune top-1 18 of 45 (was 13), combined tune reach 33 of 45 (was 28), holdout top-1 5 of 44 (was 3), false offers 0 of 35, typed recall 24 of 44 and needs_mode_floor 1 of 35, all unchanged except the plain gains.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/after-capture.json\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/before-capture.json\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The five tune rows that moved are exactly the five scored commands and each now carries its own command at top-1; no other published tune row changed.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/after-capture.json\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The holdout gain is two rows, from /doctor:install and /doctor:speckit each moving 0 of 1 to 1 of 1; the other three stayed 0 of 1, and only counts were read.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/after-capture.json\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The three doctor-family floor rows at 0.82 still pass and still offer nothing: all keep system-skilled-doctor as the top and remain inside the unchanged false-offer total of 0 of 35.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/after-capture.json\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"/create:skill-parent cannot move from embedding text: it has no TypeScript bridge, no stored vector and no capture row, so its plain row stays empty despite the scratch text growing from 187 to 369 characters.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/metadata/enriched-embedding-text.json\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/after-capture.json\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-007\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The measured gain is the vector half only: the capture still reads the tracked bridge projection for lexical evidence, so the build's lexical addition is not in these numbers; the scratch re-embed of five vectors plus two parity calls took 0.15 s wall with the model warm.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"re-embedding /create:skill-parent with no scorer row\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"There is no vec_cmd_768 row and no TypeScript id, so the update would write a vector nothing reads.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"overwriting the tracked bridge projection to test the lexical half\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"It would modify a tracked file and break the isolation the measurement needs.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2}\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/deltas/iter-002.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794570953628,"end":1794570971131}}}}
