{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794571193010,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4abd5affeHy554lSqReHMR4","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4c709ae001Wi5v7JI4WLooX3","sessionID":"ses_e2b4abd5affeHy554lSqReHMR4","messageID":"msg_1d4c701cc001Lf3ffRcNjJCEFs","type":"tool","id":"call_176738a5a2c240a7a1171530","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"runId\":\"fanout-embed-text-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-embed-text-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-embed-text-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":3,\"status\":\"insight\",\"focus\":\"KQ3: build or decline with the exact files and the measured gain\",\"findingsCount\":7,\"newInfoRatio\":0.35,\"noveltyJustification\":\"The synthesis adds the build file list, the re-embed path, the lexical-half risk and the clean-worktree check; the gain numbers restate iteration 2.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ3: Does the measured gain justify a build, with the exact files and the measured gain, or a decline, with the number; and which of the six cannot benefit until it has a scorer row?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ3: Does the measured gain justify a build, with the exact files and the measured gain, or a decline, with the number; and which of the six cannot benefit until it has a scorer row?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"declining the build\",\"treating /create:skill-parent as part of the measured gain\",\"claiming the lexical half as measured\"],\"focusTrack\":\"embed-text\",\"edgeCase\":\"none\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"Grep\",\"Write\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/research-segment-3.md:75,95,209\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml:65,376,626,758\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/command-metadata.json:215\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/command-metadata.json:48\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:135\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/scoring-compatibility.json\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/skill-graph/scan.ts:49-62\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/after-capture.json\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T11:59:32.000Z\",\"durationMs\":193000,\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-001\",\"label\":\"Answer: build the five scored commands. The vector-only gain is tune top-1 13 to 18 of 45, combined tune reach 28 to 33, holdout top-1 3 to 5 of 44, with false offers 0 of 35, typed 24 of 44 and the three floor rows unchanged.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/after-capture.json\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/research-segment-3.md\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-002\",\"label\":\"Exact edits: 5 phrases each to /doctor:install, /doctor:setup and /doctor:speckit plus 4 to /doctor:update in .skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml, and 4 phrases to /speckit:search userIntent.ownedSignals in .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/command-metadata.json.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/command-metadata.json\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-003\",\"label\":\"/create:skill-parent needs a scorer row before its text can matter: add its four signals, add a TypeScript activation entry in scoring-compatibility.json, flip its generated scorerRow at command-attach.ts:135 by rerunning the deriver, then re-embed.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/command-metadata.json\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/scoring-compatibility.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-004\",\"label\":\"The re-embed step already exists: skill_graph_scan calls indexSkillMetadata then refreshSkillEmbeddings, so the changed bridge projection refreshes command vectors; the scratch path reproduced a stored vector at cosine 1.000000 in 0.15 s warm.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/skill-graph/scan.ts\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/metadata/reembed-report.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-005\",\"label\":\"The measured gain is a lower bound because the build also adds lexical evidence in the TypeScript scorer; the 0 of 35 false-offer gate is the control and a broad phrase must be narrowed if it moves.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/scratch/after-capture.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-006\",\"label\":\"The build must recapture the fixture baseline with --write and rerun the doctor route validators, then require tune 18 of 45 or better, holdout 5 of 44 or better, false offers 0 of 35 and typed 24 of 44.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/route-validate.sh\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-007\",\"label\":\"No tracked file changed: all writes are inside the lineage, and the metadata files, database and generated bridge projection are clean in git status.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/database/skill-graph.sqlite\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"declining the build\",\"reason\":\"The measured cost of declining is 5 tune rows and 2 holdout rows left without a command, with no floor movement to justify the loss.\",\"iteration\":3}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"treating /create:skill-parent as part of the measured gain\",\"reason\":\"Its measured gain is 0 until a scorer row exists.\",\"iteration\":3}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"claiming the lexical half as measured\",\"reason\":\"The scratch capture read the tracked bridge projection, so the lexical addition is a build-time risk, not a measured gain.\",\"iteration\":3}\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/deltas/iter-003.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/deltas/iter-003.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/embed-text-4/deltas/iter-003.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-embed-text-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-embed-text-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-embed-text-4-17945700