{"type":"text","timestamp":1794571466968,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4abd5affeHy554lSqReHMR4","part":{"id":"prt_1d4cb6d2f002V5gguAaB1jIh1m","sessionID":"ses_e2b4abd5affeHy554lSqReHMR4","messageID":"msg_1d4cb3d90001jDohGJScAd1yEH","type":"text","text":"## Embed-Text Lane Complete\n\n**Answer: build the five scored commands.** The measured vector-only gain is real and the floors hold.\n\n| Measure | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| Plain tune top-1 | 13 of 45 | **18 of 45 (+5)** |\n| Plain holdout top-1 | 3 of 44 | **5 of 44 (+2)** |\n| False offers | 0 of 35 | **0 of 35** |\n| Typed recall | 24 of 44 | 24 of 44 |\n\nThe three doctor-family floor rows at 0.82 (`mns-chat-03`, `nm-system-skilled-doctor-01`, `sv-03`) still pass and still offer no command.\n\n**Build files:** `.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml` (install, setup, speckit, update trigger phrases), `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/command-metadata.json` (`/speckit:search`), and `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/command-metadata.json` (`/create:skill-parent`). Re-embed with `skill_graph_scan`. `/create:skill-parent` needs a scorer row first; its measured gain today is 0.\n\n**Caveat:** the measurement isolates the embedding-vector half. The build's lexical addition is unmeasured; the 0 of 35 false-offer gate is its control.\n\nEvidence: `research/lineages/embed-text-4/research.md`, `iterations/iteration-001..003.md`, `scratch/before-capture.json`, `scratch/after-capture.json`. No tracked file changed.\n\nFANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:embed-text-4","time":{"start":1794571463983,"end":1794571466968}}}
